From 61304e7964d6de75e6d1582ece205d9269bb378c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefano Borghini <projects@stefanoborghinidesign.it>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 18:33:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add /start micro-landing for Instagram bio traffic

Mobile-first editorial hub (not a Linktree-style button list): logo,
compact hero, dominant "Create Your Experience" CTA into the
configurator, three secondary editorial link-cards (explore the site,
curated experiences, stay/eat/discover), a low-key work-with-us link,
and a minimal footer. Preserves incoming UTM params through to the
configurator link for GA4 campaign attribution, and adds dedicated
GA4 events (start_page_view, click_create_experience,
click_explore_portovenere, click_curated_experiences,
click_stay_eat_discover, click_work_with_us) via the existing
trackEvent() helper. noindex/follow since it's a pure funnel page
with thin/duplicate content vs the homepage.

Stay/Eat/Discover and Work With Us point at WhatsApp/email
placeholders until dedicated pages exist; Instagram icon slot is
wired but hidden until a real handle is supplied.
---
